### Tujuan di Kepulauan Seribu (luar wilayah studi)
# Harapan: 422 outside_study_area
POST {{host}}/v1/routes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": {
    "lat": -6.1754,
    "lon": 106.8272
  },
  "destination": {
    "lat": -5.75,
    "lon": 106.55
  },
  "mode": "walk",
  "pollutant": "pm25",
  "preference": {
    "alpha": 0.5,
    "beta": 0.5
  }
}

### Pantai Ancol → laut (tidak dekat jalan)
